{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/1/b91381b367f9753ded66ab981c7451f2cb117578.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OABC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> be a unit square in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />-plane with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/d/21d0fd31c327d335a4184b4680a49c43b28d525b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O(0,0),A(1,0),B(1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"178\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfde3678c7d065d8e14f62aa9a14ad134eb1bd4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(0,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff6a073660ed74fca3d0d48ab40d1da3d1bab59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=x^2-y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/380dff07c0fea276a287fe70825c3b058c38dfa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v=xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"11\" /> be a transformation of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />-plane into the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4af6ae0ada20981b5d1ae4b17676e2cc12be86fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$uv$\" width=\"19\" height=\"8\" />-plane. The transform (or image) of the square is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cecfb02cfee22de6e499dcc97763543afbfc9c14.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-3,0)--(3,0),EndArrow); draw((0,-4)--(0,4),EndArrow); draw((-1,0)--(0,2)--(1,0)--(0,-2)--cycle,dot); MP(&quot;(A)&quot;,(-5,2),SW); MP(&quot;O&quot;,(0,0),SW); MP(&quot;(-1,0)&quot;,(-1,0),SW); MP(&quot;(0,2)&quot;,(0,2),NE); MP(&quot;(1,0)&quot;,(1,0),SE); MP(&quot;(0,-2)&quot;,(0,-2),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7db9c85e711b0ebc0990081c6b315e65783590.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-3,0)--(3,0),EndArrow); draw((0,-4)--(0,4),EndArrow); draw(arc((1.5,0),2.5,126,234),black); draw(arc((-1.5,0),2.5,54,-54),black); MP(&quot;(B)&quot;,(-5,2),SW); MP(&quot;O&quot;,(0,0),SW); MP(&quot;(-1,0)&quot;,(-1,0),SW); MP(&quot;(0,2)&quot;,(0,2),NE); MP(&quot;(1,0)&quot;,(1,0),SE); MP(&quot;(0,-2)&quot;,(0,-2),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/958be5aac7fe743672089ae597a6c074a25d5fc9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-3,0)--(3,0),EndArrow); draw((0,-4)--(0,4),EndArrow); draw((-1,0)--(0,2)--(1,0),black); MP(&quot;(C)&quot;,(-5,2),SW); MP(&quot;O&quot;,(0,0),SW); MP(&quot;(-1,0)&quot;,(-1,0),SW); MP(&quot;(0,2)&quot;,(0,2),NE); MP(&quot;(1,0)&quot;,(1,0),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/f/21fa6a2cfee859cf851135a9d54dbecfc7e5a93c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-3,0)--(3,0),EndArrow); draw((0,-4)--(0,4),EndArrow); draw(arc((1.5,0),2.5,126,180),black); draw(arc((-1.5,0),2.5,54,0),black); MP(&quot;(D)&quot;,(-5,2),SW); MP(&quot;O&quot;,(0,0),SW); MP(&quot;(-1,0)&quot;,(-1,0),SW); MP(&quot;(0,2)&quot;,(0,2),NE); MP(&quot;(1,0)&quot;,(1,0),SE); MP(&quot;(0,-2)&quot;,(0,-2),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"215\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/2/8b22249c033bee7452780fec1b02d0a66614e126.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-3,0)--(3,0),EndArrow); draw((0,-4)--(0,4),EndArrow); draw((-1,0)--(0,1)--(1,0)--(0,-1)--cycle,dot); MP(&quot;(E)&quot;,(-5,2),SW); MP(&quot;O&quot;,(.1,.1),SW); MP(&quot;(-1,0)&quot;,(-1,0),SW); MP(&quot;(0,1)&quot;,(0,1),NE); MP(&quot;(1,0)&quot;,(1,0),SE); MP(&quot;(0,-1)&quot;,(0,-1),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each point on the square can be in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a40d2badbac4bdd4c5ffb5628c2e13a071bd14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0e4ce70e3f5884b02cdf57c2318a6fbd8f8d7ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66f8c3a4b9b4588cd354272c3760b08ca53f16a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/8/f68beef2894db157ff1edac62d42f472dc5d8158.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/e/e9e34e25ca52e8489edddd468a27769f14f43832.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le x,y \\le 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />.  Making the appropriate substitutions results in points being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57cb848a00fcf7ea0b811eaa9acda614895f9e6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-y^2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/7650834a5fff3aa80265c047874169b88bc18a07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-y^2,2y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/10176eec082b37c05fc2b7a83b743b35318ad67a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/cea45da9f5c289edfc0036608356989c5ed43351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - 1,2x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"19\" /> on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4af6ae0ada20981b5d1ae4b17676e2cc12be86fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$uv$\" width=\"19\" height=\"8\" />-plane.  \n</p><p>Notice that since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/0258a542503a87f85c511bb8ab73db874fa43568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, none of the points are below the u-axis, so options A,B, and E are out.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79441b1f063de180cc49661ea07debcc32d2b70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\tfrac{v}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc974bbe297f92ef675c08a2afbbd79e6a8d8ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = (\\tfrac{v}{2})^2 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33bb6e53084489055852d0df7912aed77d7c0768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v = 2\\sqrt{u+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbc2710ab2a25e2716587c9790780b1fb49ed4b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 \\le u \\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" />.  That means some of the lines are not straight, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti